      "content": "{\"ok\": true, \"entities\": [{\"id\": \"SPACE_UNIT\", \"name\": \"SPACE_UNIT\", \"desc\": \"Space unit dimension table: one row per space unit (an organizational space-assignment unit such as a department, program, or office that receives space allocation), with space unit key/code, space unit name, the facilities organization it belongs to, and DLC key. Bridges FCLT_ORGANIZATION (organization attribution) and SPACE_DETAIL (rooms assigned to the space unit); used to group room counts and space statistics by space unit.\", \"columns\": {\"FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Foreign key to FCLT_ORGANIZATION.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY; the organization that owns/occupies this space unit\"}, \"SPACE_UNIT_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the space unit; joins to SPACE_DETAIL.SPACE_UNIT_KEY and SPACE_UNIT2.SPACE_UNIT_KEY; used for partitioning/ordering in space analyses\"}, \"SPACE_UNIT_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Business code of the space unit (same numeric value as the key in current data)\"}, \"SPACE_UNIT\": {\"desc\": \"Name of the space unit, e.g. 'Physics', 'Technology & Policy Program'\"}, \"DLC_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Department/Lab/Center key, e.g. 'D_PHYSICS'; may contain composite values like 'D_DSL:HQ'\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per space unit\"}, {\"id\": \"SPACE_UNIT2\", \"name\": \"SPACE_UNIT2\", \"desc\": \"Alternative space unit lookup table containing space unit key, code, name, and DLC key, but without the FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY organization attribution present in SPACE_UNIT. Holds fewer space units than SPACE_UNIT; used when only space unit identity/name is needed without organization linkage.\", \"columns\": {\"SPACE_UNIT_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the space unit; same value domain as SPACE_UNIT.SPACE_UNIT_KEY and referenced by SPACE_DETAIL.SPACE_UNIT_KEY\"}, \"SPACE_UNIT_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Business code of the space unit\"}, \"SPACE_UNIT\": {\"desc\": \"Name of the space unit\"}, \"DLC_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Department/Lab/Center key of the space unit\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per space unit\"}, {\"id\": \"SPACE_DETAIL\", \"name\": \"SPACE_DETAIL\", \"desc\": \"Space assignment detail fact table: one row per physical room assigned to a space unit, with building/floor/space-unit/space-usage keys, room identifiers (building-room number and name, room number), room square footage, room counter, and building component. Used to count rooms per space unit or per building, and to analyze room size and usage distribution. Joins to SPACE_UNIT via SPACE_UNIT_KEY, FCLT_BUILDING via BUILDING_KEY, SPACE_FLOOR via FLOOR_KEY, and SPACE_USAGE via SPACE_USAGE_KEY.\", \"columns\": {\"BUILDING_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Foreign key to FCLT_BUILDING.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY; the building containing the room; used to find the building with the most rooms within a space unit\"}, \"FLOOR_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Foreign key to SPACE_FLOOR.FLOOR_KEY; the floor the room is on\"}, \"SPACE_UNIT_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Foreign key to SPACE_UNIT.SPACE_UNIT_KEY; the space unit the room is assigned to\"}, \"SPACE_USAGE_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Foreign key to SPACE_USAGE.SPACE_USAGE_KEY; the usage classification of the room (e.g. classroom, office, lab)\"}, \"BUILDING_ROOM\": {\"desc\": \"Combined building-room identifier, e.g. '1-080'; counting rows of this column gives the number of rooms per space unit/building\"}, \"BUILDING_ROOM_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Room name (usually identical to BUILDING_ROOM)\"}, \"ROOM_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Room number within the building, e.g. '80', '82F'\"}, \"ROOM_SQUARE_FOOTAGE\": {\"desc\": \"Room area in square feet (note: FCLT_ROOMS.AREA is in square meters)\"}, \"ROOM_COUNTER\": {\"desc\": \"Room count indicator; equals 1 for every room row, so SUM(ROOM_COUNTER) also yields room counts\"}, \"BUILDING_COMPONENT\": {\"desc\": \"Building component identifier the room belongs to\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per room assigned to a space unit\", \"entity\": {\"columns\": {\"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date of the room assignment record, stored as DD-MON-YY text (e.g. '19-DEC-24'); all current rows carry '19-DEC-24'. This is the room-side load date used to filter which room snapshot to analyze; it is distinct from SPACE_FLOOR.WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE (the floor lookup record's load date), which is the column to report when a question asks for the floor's warehouse load date.\"}}}, \"reason\": \"Case dw_2528 filters rooms on SPACE_DETAIL.WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE='19-DEC-24' while reporting the floor's warehouse load date from SPACE_FLOOR; the two same-named columns are confusing and their difference (room snapshot load date vs floor lookup load date, DD-MON-YY text format) must be documented per column description rules.\"}, {\"id\": \"ZPM_ROOMS_LOAD\", \"name\": \"ZPM_ROOMS_LOAD\", \"desc\": \"Space-planning room load table: one row per room record from the space planning feed, with the building-room identifier, building component, floor (numeric or label such as 'G9'), space usage text (e.g. 'DSGN STUDIO', 'CONF RM'), space unit code, HR organization unit id, and room access level. Links rooms to SPACE_UNIT via SPACE_UNIT_CODE and to FCLT_ORGANIZATION/HR_ORG_UNIT via HR_ORG_UNIT_ID; used for floor/access-level/space-usage room analysis from the space-planning perspective, without the area and use-key columns carried by FCLT_ROOMS.\", \"columns\": {\"BUILDING_ROOM\": {\"desc\": \"Combined building-room identifier, e.g. '1-073'; same identifier convention as FCLT_ROOMS.BUILDING_ROOM and SPACE_DETAIL.BUILDING_ROOM\"}, \"BUILDING_COMPONENT\": {\"desc\": \"Building component identifier (the building part the room belongs to), used for ordering rooms within buildings\"}, \"FLOOR\": {\"desc\": \"Floor of the room; stored as text, mostly numeric floor numbers but also labels such as 'G9'; filter with FLOOR = 2 for second-floor rooms\"}, \"SPACE_USAGE\": {\"desc\": \"Space usage text classification of the room, e.g. 'DSGN STUDIO', 'CONF RM', 'DINING RM'; a free-text counterpart of the coded SPACE_USAGE_KEY in SPACE_DETAIL\"}, \"SPACE_UNIT_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Business code of the space unit the room is assigned to; joins to SPACE_UNIT.SPACE_UNIT_CODE\"}, \"HR_ORG_UNIT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"HR organization unit identifier of the unit occupying the room; joins to FCLT_ORGANIZATION.HR_ORG_UNIT_ID and HR_ORG_UNIT.HR_ORG_UNIT_ID\"}, \"ACCESS_LEVEL\": {\"desc\": \"Numeric access restriction level of the room (observed values 0-3); ACCESS_LEVEL = 1 selects the least-restricted rooms\"}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per room record in the space-planning load\"}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per room record in the space-planning load\"}, {\"id\": \"FCLT_ROOMS\", \"name\": \"FCLT_ROOMS\", \"desc\": \"Facilities room inventory table: one row per physical room with building/floor keys, room identifiers, use classifications (major/minor use), organization assignment, area in square meters, access level, and geographic coordinates. Joins to FCLT_BUILDING via FCLT_BUILDING_KEY; referenced by COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.MEET_PLACE via FCLT_ROOM_KEY.\", \"columns\": {\"FCLT_ROOM_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the room; joins to COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.MEET_PLACE for class-meeting location analysis\"}, \"BUILDING_ROOM\": {\"desc\": \"Combined building-room identifier\"}, \"FCLT_BUILDING_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Building identifier key of the room, storing the building number/code itself (e.g. 'E38', '14N'); can be filtered directly for a building or joined to FCLT_BUILDING.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY for building attributes\"}, \"FLOOR\": {\"desc\": \"Floor the room is on\"}, \"FCLT_FLOOR_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Foreign key to FCLT_FLOOR\"}, \"ROOM\": {\"desc\": \"Room number/name\"}, \"SPACE_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Space identifier\"}, \"FCLT_MAJOR_USE_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Major use key of the room; joins to FCLT_MAJOR_USE.FCLT_MAJOR_USE_KEY to decode the major use code/description and assignable flag\"}, \"MAJOR_USE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Major use description, e.g. classroom\"}, \"FCLT_USE_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"\"}, \"USE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Use description of the room\"}, \"FCLT_MINOR_USE_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Minor use key of the room\"}, \"MINOR_USE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Minor use description\"}, \"FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Organization key of the room\"}, \"ORGANIZATION_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Organization name occupying the room\"}, \"FCLT_MINOR_ORGANIZATION_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Minor organization key of the room\"}, \"MINOR_ORGANIZATION\": {\"desc\": \"Minor organization name\"}, \"AREA\": {\"desc\": \"Room area in square meters; used in area statistics (average, range, variance)\"}, \"ROOM_FULL_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Full room name\"}, \"DEPT_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Department code assigned to the room\"}, \"ACCESS_LEVEL\": {\"desc\": \"Numeric access level code of the room (observed values 0-3); used to filter rooms by access restriction level, e.g. ACCESS_LEVEL = 1\"}, \"LATITUDE_WGS\": {\"desc\": \"Latitude (WGS)\"}, \"LONGITUDE_WGS\": {\"desc\": \"Longitude (WGS)\"}, \"NORTHING_SPCS\": {\"desc\": \"Northing coordinate (SPCS)\"}, \"EASTING_SPCS\": {\"desc\": \"Easting coordinate (SPCS)\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per room\"}, {\"id\": \"FAC_ROOMS\", \"name\": \"FAC_ROOMS\", \"desc\": \"Facilities room snapshot table with the same room inventory structure as FCLT_ROOMS (building/floor keys, room identifiers, major/minor use classifications, organization assignment, area, access level, coordinates) but keyed by FAC_ROOM_KEY and joining the FAC_* family (FAC_BUILDING, FAC_FLOOR, FAC_ORGANIZATION). Used as an alternative room source when FAC_* family keys are involved.\", \"columns\": {\"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}, \"FAC_ROOM_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the room in the FAC_* family\"}, \"BUILDING_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Foreign key to FAC_BUILDING.FAC_BUILDING_KEY\"}, \"FLOOR\": {\"desc\": \"Floor the room is on\"}, \"FLOOR_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Foreign key to FAC_FLOOR.FLOOR_KEY\"}, \"ROOM\": {\"desc\": \"Room number/name\"}, \"SPACE_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Space identifier\"}, \"MAJOR_USE_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Major use key of the room\"}, \"MAJOR_USE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Major use description, e.g. classroom\"}, \"USE_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Use key of the room\"}, \"USE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Use description of the room\"}, \"MINOR_USE_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Minor use key of the room\"}, \"MINOR_USE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Minor use description\"}, \"ORGANIZATION_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Foreign key to FAC_ORGANIZATION.ORGANIZATION_KEY; organization occupying the room\"}, \"ORGANIZATION_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Organization name occupying the room\"}, \"MINOR_ORGANIZATION_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Key of the secondary organization for the room\"}, \"MINOR_ORGANIZATION\": {\"desc\": \"Secondary organization name\"}, \"AREA\": {\"desc\": \"Room area in square meters\"}, \"ROOM_FULL_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Full room name\"}, \"DEPT_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Department code assigned to the room\"}, \"ACCESS_LEVEL\": {\"desc\": \"Access level of the room\"}, \"LATITUDE_WGS\": {\"desc\": \"Latitude (WGS)\"}, \"LONGITUDE_WGS\": {\"desc\": \"Longitude (WGS)\"}, \"NORTHING_SPCS\": {\"desc\": \"Northing coordinate (SPCS)\"}, \"EASTING_SPCS\": {\"desc\": \"Easting coordinate (SPCS)\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per physical room\"}], \"not_found\": []}"
