    {
      "role": "tool",
      "tool_call_id": "call_6b567b5dc1414c14b7655940",
      "name": "semantic_graph",
      "content": "{\"ok\": true, \"count\": 11, \"items\": [{\"relation_type\": \"joins\", \"direction\": \"outgoing\", \"desc\": \"Facilities organization dimension table: one row per organization in the institute's hierarchical organization tree (levels 1-6, from institute-wide down to sub-units), with organization identifiers and names, parent and major-organization attribution, hierarchy level, assignable-space flag, course number for academic departments, description, DLC (department/lab/center) key and name, and cross-references to HR organization units. Parent of SPACE_UNIT (space assigned to organizations) and referenced by FCLT_ROOMS via FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY for room occupancy attribution.\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"FCLT_ORGANIZATION\", \"name\": \"FCLT_ORGANIZATION\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"joins\", \"direction\": \"incoming\", \"desc\": \"Space assignment detail fact table: one row per physical room assigned to a space unit, with building/floor/space-unit/space-usage keys, room identifiers (building-room number and name, room number), room square footage, room counter, and building component. Used to count rooms per space unit or per building, and to analyze room size and usage distribution. Joins to SPACE_UNIT via SPACE_UNIT_KEY, FCLT_BUILDING via BUILDING_KEY, SPACE_FLOOR via FLOOR_KEY, and SPACE_USAGE via SPACE_USAGE_KEY.\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"SPACE_DETAIL\", \"name\": \"SPACE_DETAIL\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"joins\", \"direction\": \"incoming\", \"desc\": \"Facilities room inventory table: one row per physical room with building/floor keys, room identifiers, use classifications (major/minor use), organization assignment, area in square meters, access level, and geographic coordinates. Joins to FCLT_BUILDING via FCLT_BUILDING_KEY; referenced by COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.MEET_PLACE via FCLT_ROOM_KEY.\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"FCLT_ROOMS\", \"name\": \"FCLT_ROOMS\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"joins\", \"direction\": \"incoming\", \"desc\": \"Space-planning room load table: one row per room record from the space planning feed, with the building-room identifier, building component, floor (numeric or label such as 'G9'), space usage text (e.g. 'DSGN STUDIO', 'CONF RM'), space unit code, HR organization unit id, and room access level. Links rooms to SPACE_UNIT via SPACE_UNIT_CODE and to FCLT_ORGANIZATION/HR_ORG_UNIT via HR_ORG_UNIT_ID; used for floor/access-level/space-usage room analysis from the space-planning perspective, without the area and use-key columns carried by FCLT_ROOMS.\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"ZPM_ROOMS_LOAD\", \"name\": \"ZPM_ROOMS_LOAD\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"joins\", \"direction\": \"incoming\", \"desc\": \"Space supervisor usage fact table: one row per supervisor (MIT_ID) recording how much space they supervise and for how many departments: department count, department DLC key list (comma-separated when multiple), number of supervisees, supervised square footage, research volume, and derived ratio measures (sqft per supervisee, sqft per research volume, research volume per sqft). Joins to SPACE_UNIT and other DLC-carrying tables via DEPT_NAMES = DLC_KEY (only single-department rows match); used for supervisor space-usage and research-volume statistics per department/DLC.\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"SPACE_SUPERVISOR_USAGE\", \"name\": \"SPACE_SUPERVISOR_USAGE\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"joins\", \"direction\": \"outgoing\", \"desc\": \"Space unit dimension table: one row per space unit (an organizational space-assignment unit such as a department, program, or office that receives space allocation), with space unit key/code, space unit name, the facilities organization it belongs to, and DLC key. Bridges FCLT_ORGANIZATION (organization attribution) and SPACE_DETAIL (rooms assigned to the space unit); used to group room counts and space statistics by space unit.\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"SPACE_UNIT\", \"name\": \"SPACE_UNIT\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"joins\", \"direction\": \"incoming\", \"desc\": \"Space unit dimension table: one row per space unit (an organizational space-assignment unit such as a department, program, or office that receives space allocation), with space unit key/code, space unit name, the facilities organization it belongs to, and DLC key. Bridges FCLT_ORGANIZATION (organization attribution) and SPACE_DETAIL (rooms assigned to the space unit); used to group room counts and space statistics by space unit.\", \"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"SPACE_UNIT\", \"name\": \"SPACE_UNIT\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"concept\", \"direction\": \"incoming\", \"desc\": \"Space unit lookup tables identifying the organizational units that receive space allocation: SPACE_UNIT (with FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY organization attribution) and SPACE_UNIT2 (identity/name only). They answer the same space-unit identity questions but differ in organization linkage and coverage.\", \"entity_type\": \"concept\", \"id\": \"concept_space_unit_dimension\", \"name\": \"Space Unit Dimension\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"column_concept\", \"direction\": \"incoming\", \"desc\": \"Space unit key columns identifying the organizational space-assignment unit across the space dimension and fact tables. SPACE_UNIT_KEY is the join key linking SPACE_DETAIL room rows to space unit identity (name/code) and, through SPACE_UNIT, to the owning facilities organization.\", \"entity_type\": \"column_concept\", \"id\": \"column_concept_space_unit_key\", \"name\": \"Space Unit Key\"}, {\"relation_type\": \"column_concept\", \"direction\": \"incoming\", \"desc\": \"Facility organization key columns attributing space units and rooms to organizations in the hierarchical organization tree. Two naming conventions exist across table families (FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY in FCLT_*/SPACE_* tables vs ORGANIZATION_KEY in FAC_* tables) with the same value domain.\", \"entity_type\": \"column_concept\", \"id\": \"column_concept_fac