r 49 rows), so it is safe as a join/group key when combining per-floor derived results (e.g. matching each floor's largest room back to floor-level attributes).\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date of the floor lookup record, stored as DD-MON-YY text (e.g. '19-DEC-24'); all current rows carry '19-DEC-24'. This is the column to report when a question asks for the floor's warehouse load date; it is distinct from SPACE_DETAIL.WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE, which is the room-side load date used to filter room assignment snapshots.\"}}}, \"reason\": \"Case dw_2528 reports SPACE_FLOOR.WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE as the floor's warehouse load date and joins derived per-floor results on FLOOR_NAME; documenting the load-date column distinction from SPACE_DETAIL and the verified uniqueness of FLOOR_NAME prevents wrong-column selection and unfounded fan-out concerns.\"}, {\"id\": \"BUILDINGS\", \"name\": \"BUILDINGS\", \"desc\": \"Space-domain building lookup table: one row per building with building key/number, building name, street and mailing addresses as single text fields, gross and assignable square footage (in square feet), and a building counter. Referenced by SPACE_DETAIL via BUILDING_KEY; a lightweight building reference for space-assignment reporting, without the type/ownership/site classification carried by FCLT_BUILDING or FAC_BUILDING.\", \"columns\": {\"BUILDING_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Building key (same value as BUILDING_NUMBER, e.g. 'NW32'); joins to SPACE_DETAIL.BUILDING_KEY and matches FCLT_BUILDING.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY value domain\"}, \"BUILDING_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Building number/code, e.g. 'NW35'\"}, \"BUILDING_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Building name, e.g. 'Ashdown House'; may be a generic 'BUILDING <number>' placeholder\"}, \"BUILDING_STREET_ADDRESS\": {\"desc\": \"Full street address as a single text field, e.g. '235 ALBANY ST'\"}, \"BUILDING_MAILING_ADDRESS\": {\"desc\": \"Mailing address as a single text field; often null\"}, \"BLDG_GROSS_SQUARE_FOOTAGE\": {\"desc\": \"Gross square footage of the building in square feet (note: FCLT_BUILDING.EXT_GROSS_AREA is in square meters)\"}, \"BLDG_ASSIGNABLE_SQUARE_FOOTAGE\": {\"desc\": \"Assignable square footage of the building in square feet\"}, \"BUILDING_COUNTER\": {\"desc\": \"Record counter; equals 1 for every building row\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per building\"}, {\"id\": \"FCLT_ORGANIZATION\", \"name\": \"FCLT_ORGANIZATION\", \"desc\": \"Facilities organization dimension table: one row per organization in the institute's hierarchical organization tree (levels 1-6, from institute-wide down to sub-units), with organization identifiers and names, parent and major-organization attribution, hierarchy level, assignable-space flag, course number for academic departments, description, DLC (department/lab/center) key and name, and cross-references to HR organization units. Parent of SPACE_UNIT (space assigned to organizations) and referenced by FCLT_ROOMS via FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY for room occupancy attribution.\", \"columns\": {\"FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the facilities organization; joins to SPACE_UNIT.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY and FCLT_ROOMS.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\"}, \"ORGANIZATION_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Organization identifier (same value as the organization key in current data)\"}, \"ORGANIZATION\": {\"desc\": \"Short organization abbreviation, e.g. 'AERO', 'ADMISS'\"}, \"ORGANIZATION_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Display name of the organization, e.g. 'AERO & ASTRO'; used for organization-name reporting\"}, \"FCLT_ORG_PARENT_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Key of the parent organization in the hierarchy tree; null for the top-level organization\"}, \"ORG_PARENT\": {\"desc\": \"Abbreviation of the parent organization, e.g. 'S ENG' (School of Engineering)\"}, \"FCLT_MAJOR_ORG_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Key of the major (top-level grouping) organization this organization rolls up to\"}, \"MAJOR